<Base
  title="Terms – WhoRuled"
  description="How the WhoRuled map and its information may be used."
  path="/terms/"
>
  <main class="page">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0">Terms</h2>
    <p>WhoRuled is a free reference map. Use it for information and education.</p>
    <h2>Accuracy</h2>
    <p>Borders, rulers and dates are approximate. Many are disputed, and some are estimates. Each ruler links to a source so you can check it. Please report errors through the <a href="https://github.com/nsijwali/WhoRuled/issues/new" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">issue tracker</a>.</p>
    <h2>Licences</h2>
    <p>The data sources and their licences are listed on the <a href="/about/">About and licences</a> page. Reuse of the map or data must follow those licences.</p>
    <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
    <p>Some pages link to books on Amazon. Those links may earn a commission for the site at no cost to you.</p>
    <h2>No warranty</h2>
    <p>The site is provided as is, without warranty of any kind. The operator is not liable for decisions made using it.</p>
  </main>
</Base>
